1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,540
I said it before, and I will say it again.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,820
It is not enough to simply just be black.

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:15,200
You have to be black, and you have to be about breaking down the imperialist empire that continues to use your blackness against you.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:24,760
You have to be committed to breaking down the imperialist empire that is allowing other countries to be used against you.

5
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:29,580
And anyone who is supporting that is not getting my support.

6
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,980
Black or not.

7
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:44,380
At the end of the day, we must honor those who are brave enough to put their futures on the line for causes that end up supporting everybody's elevation.

8
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:48,180
An example of that is these students that are currently protesting.

9
00:00:48,400 --> 00:01:03,020
The same students who, though peacefully protesting, are having the same militarized state-sanctioned police force put upon them that we as black people in this country have been fighting against since we were let out of slavery and into their hands.

10
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:18,180
So miss me with any kumbaya bullshit that is expected, because at the end of the day, we can no longer support black people who are supporting any structures that are propping up the white supremacy that continues to oppress us.

11
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:18,920
Period.

12
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,100
Period.

13
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:23,580
Someone asked me today, don't you ever get tired of standing on business?

14
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:24,280
No.

15
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,940
I was born on business.

16
00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:26,820
Pa-dum-bum!

